<< /A 16419 0 R /Alt (Table comparing proposed validity types for Design Science Research \(DSR\) with corresponding validity types in basic literature. The table includes five rows: Instrument Validity, Technical Validity, Design Validity, Purpose Validity, and Generalization \(External Validity\). Each row lists corresponding validity types and references. For example, Instrument Validity corresponds to Construct Validity and Measurement Validity, with references to Cronbach & Meehl \(1955\), Messick \(1989\), Cook & Campbell \(1979\), and Shadish et al. \(2002\). The table emphasizes the importance of different validity types in research design and application.) /K 2 /P 2946 0 R /S /Figure /Type /StructElem >>
